SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ssttrrccoollll() function conforms to ISO/IEC 9899:1990 (“ISO C90”).  The
     ssttrrccoollll__ll() function conforms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).

